# Cloudflare redirects. One rule per line: /from /to 301
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Prefer this file for URL changes on Cloudflare: it emits real 301s, whereas
# Astro's `redirects` config generates meta-refresh HTML pages (worse for SEO).
# When you rename a published slug, add a line here AND keep the Astro
# `redirects` map in astro.config.mjs in sync for non-Cloudflare hosts.
#
# Example:
# /pet-behavior/old-slug/ /pet-behavior/new-slug/ 301
